From: Redmi AX3000 NSS integration
Subject: [PATCH] ath11k: exclude VHT SU Partial AID before STBC NSS conversion

Bits 21:13 of the VHT SU SIG-A field carry Partial AID. Dividing the full
12-bit field before masking moves an AID bit into the spatial stream count,
turning a one-stream STBC sample into NSS 5. Keep the existing MU branch.

--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/hal_rx.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath11k/hal_rx.c
@@ -1101,6 +1101,13 @@
 
 		ppdu_info->is_stbc = info0 & HAL_RX_VHT_SIG_A_INFO_INFO0_STBC;
 		nsts = FIELD_GET(HAL_RX_VHT_SIG_A_INFO_INFO0_NSTS, info0);
+		group_id = FIELD_GET(HAL_RX_VHT_SIG_A_INFO_INFO0_GROUP_ID,
+				     info0);
+		/* SU bits 21:13 contain Partial AID, not NSTS. Mask them before
+		 * STBC division so an AID bit cannot become a spatial stream bit.
+		 */
+		if (group_id == 0 || group_id == 63)
+			nsts &= VHT_SIG_SU_NSS_MASK;
 		if (ppdu_info->is_stbc && nsts > 0)
 			nsts = ((nsts + 1) >> 1) - 1;
